  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advisory Group on agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">There is a strong imperative within the Kurdistan Regional Government to rebuild the agri-food sector in the Kurdistan Region Iraq, as the sector could be an important provider of employment and income and thus an enabler of sustainable stability. Re-establishing the Kurdish agri-food sector is potentially feasible, but requires a comprehensive overarching approach, which covers the whole value chain. The Kurdistan Regional Government has requested Dutch support in developing a strategy to revitalize the agricultural sector in the Kurdistan Region Irq, via participation in an Advisory Group.The purpose of this project is to contribute to rebuilding a sustainable modern agri-food sector in the Kurdistan Region Iraq, based on available resources in land, water, energy, and labour.</narrative>
  </description>
